  "finding": "At the number-specific map point the two dated aerial images place the marker among vegetation. Several roofs surround the lawn; the ground-level photographed L and its small pool cannot be separately traced to a unique roof polygon in both dates. The combined historical name/number and two co-visible glazed wings identify this stand-alone architectural study. No house, roof or hotel parcel is replaced in the ordinary city model."
